      "text": "(from Jan 2027 - reliable to scrape,\nand ABSENCE = a violation you can name)\n\nSelling price + PRIOR PRICE (30-day low)\nSponsored / ad label\nRanking parameters disclosure\nBest-before / use-before date\nReturn + refund terms\nWarranty details\nDelivery details\nPayment details\nSeller details\nDark-pattern compliance certificate\nNCH grievance linkage\nData-consent notice",
