      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Drip pricing  -  fees appear at checkout\nBasket sneaking  -  extra item auto-added\nConfirm shaming  -  \"No, I like paying more\"\nSubscription trap  -  hard to cancel\nFalse urgency  -  fake countdown / stock\nForced action, nagging, interface interference\nBait and switch, disguised ads,\nSaaS billing, rogue malware prompts\n\nBoat example:  Rs.50 \"account protection\"\nsilently added at checkout  =  basket sneaking",
