      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Each field goes OUT to its own source:\n\n  GST portal      ->  is the seller real?\n  boAt.com        ->  authorised seller?\n  BIS portal      ->  licence valid?\n  GS1             ->  barcode real?\n  Own price log   ->  is prior price true?\n\nReturns only:\nMATCH  /  MISMATCH  /  UNKNOWN",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each field goes OUT to its own source:\n\n  GST portal      ->  is the seller real?\n  boAt.com        ->  authorised seller?\n  BIS portal      ->  licence valid?\n  GS1             ->  barcode real?\n  Own price log   ->  is prior price true?\n\nReturns only:\nMATCH  /  MISMATCH  /  UNKNOWN",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aM",
      "autoResize": true
