      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Price as a FAKE signal, not a saving.\nNow checks the legally required prior price.\n\nExample:  claims 70% off MRP Rs.3,990.\nPrior price (30-day low) was Rs.1,249.\nThe discount is manufactured.\n\n->  FALSE DISCOUNT CLAIM",
      "textAlign": "left",
