      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Does NOT score.  It REACTS to the verdict.\nRuns only when the score is low.\nFinds a SAFER product, not a cheaper one.\n\nExample:  same Rockerz 450 from boAt\nOfficial Store, Rs.1,499, trust score 88.\n\n->  Rs.300 more, but real.\n->  a price tool would have picked the fake.",
